mlflow:registry:searchRegisteredModels.description:
Searches registered models with an optional MLflow [filter string](https://mlflow.org/docs/latest/api_reference/rest-api.html#search-registeredmodels).

REST: `/api/2.0/mlflow/registered-models/search`.

